----------------------------
Rust dependencies keep their own licenses (see Cargo.lock).

If code or substantial structure is ever taken from an open-source project
(for example IntelliJ Community / PyCharm Community, Apache-2.0), record it
here with: source URL, commit, file(s), license, and what was changed.

